        <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
Fixes the ``.ini`` file :raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;` :raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;`

Thin non-virtual wrapper over #fixImpl, matching how the pure-Python original&apos;s public
``fix`` delegates to its own ``_fix`` with ``withBoilerPlate``/``withSrc`` both forced
to ``true`` -- those two are internal knobs only the fixing pipeline itself varies, so
they aren&apos;t part of this public entry point. Override #fixImpl, not this
</verbatim></para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>parseData</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The parse data to fix from <ndash/> see <ref refid="class_a_g_remap_core_1_1_base_ini_fixer_1a569d00b6d3dd14f43c155142efb365d1" kindref="member">ParseData</ref> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>keepBackup</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Whether to keep backups for the .ini file. <bold>Default</bold>: <computeroutput>true</computeroutput> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>fixOnly</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Whether to only fix the .ini file without undoing any fixes. <bold>Default</bold>: <computeroutput>false</computeroutput> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>hideOrig</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Whether to hide the mod for the original character. <bold>Default</bold>: <computeroutput>false</computeroutput> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>fixingCtx</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The per-call options for this fix <ndash/> see :cpp:class:<computeroutput><ref refid="struct_a_g_remap_core_1_1_ini_fixing_context" kindref="compound">IniFixingContext</ref></computeroutput>. <bold>Default</bold>: a default-constructed one</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>The new content of the fixed .ini file(s), keyed by file path </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
